<article data-id="welcome">
    <header>
        <h3>{{{i18n 'Welcome!'}}}</h3>
    </header>
    <div class="pad-wrapper">
        <p>{{{i18n 'Welcome to the Bliniversary Canvas! This website is an online multiplayer pixel canvas created for the amazing community of <a href="https://twitch.tv/dyarikku" target="_blank">DyaRikku</a> by Yolopro177 for the 2026 Bliniversary. The Bliniversary Canvas is a customized version of <a href="https://pxls.space" target="_blank">pxls.space</a>, an open source version of Reddit\'s <a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/place" target="_blank">r/place</a>.'}}}</p>
        <p>{{{i18n ''}}}</p>
        <p>{{{i18n 'Please take the time to read the rules below before proceeding. Have fun creating (or changing) art on this canvas!'}}}</p>
    </div>
</article>
<article data-id="canvas-rules" id="canvas-rules">
    <header>
        <h3 class="text-red">{{{i18n 'Canvas Rules'}}}</h3>
    </header>
    <div class="pad-wrapper" id="rules-content">
        <p>{{{i18n 'We want this canvas to be open to art without interference on our end, and especially censorship. But since we also want this place to be comfy, rules have been set in place. Before you continue, please acknowledge and follow the guidelines listed below. Using this website means agreeing to these rules of conduct.:'}}}</p>
        <ol>
	    <li>{{{i18n 'Only DyaRikku, her friends & vtuber babies related content on this canvas. This pixel canvas was set up for Rikku\'s 2026 Bliniversary, so please keep it mostly Rikku or Blin related.'}}}</li>
            <li>{{{i18n 'No hateful imagery or derogatory speech. This includes but is not limited to words.'}}}</li>
            <li>{{{i18n 'No NSFW or NSFL content.'}}}
                <ul>
                    <li>{{{i18n 'No nudity or otherwise sexually explicit content'}}}
                        <ul>
                            <li>{{{i18n 'No female-presenting nipples/bare breasts, genitalia, sexual fluids'}}}</li>
                        </ul>
                    </li>
                    <li>{{{i18n 'No sexual imagery/erotica'}}}</li>
                    <li>{{{i18n 'No excessive blood or otherwise obscene/shocking content'}}}</li>
                </ul>
            </li>
            <li>{{{i18n 'No more than <b>one</b> account per user, no exceptions. Multiple account users will be banned from creating art on the canvas.'}}}
                <ul>{{{i18n 'In case you want to log in with both your Twitch & Discord account, please contact <b>yolopro177</b> on Discord to arrange this for you!'}}}</ul>
            </li>
            <li>{{{i18n 'No auto-placement tools of any kind, you must place the pixels manually.'}}}</li>
            <li>{{{i18n 'Do not abuse site functionality, such as reports or lookups. (e.g. automated reporting/lookups, etc.)'}}}</li>
            <li>{{{i18n 'Any automated aggregation of data from user lookups is not allowed, and will result in a ban.'}}}</li>
	    <li>{{{i18n 'No doxxing, threats or any sort of hate.'}}}</li>
	    <li>{{{i18n 'Any sort of behavior that is considered unacceptable, disrespectful or uncomfortable will result in punishment, even if not explicitly stated in these rules, may result in a ban. Staff has the final say in any rule disputes.'}}}
                <ul>{{{i18n 'If you feel a moderator has acted inappropriately, please report it to an administrator.'}}}</ul>
            </li>
        </ol>
        <p>{{{i18n 'If you believe you have been falsely banned you may contact a moderator.'}}}</p>
    </div>
</article>
<article data-id="chat-rules" id="chat-rules">
    <header>
        <h3 class="text-red">{{{i18n 'Chat Rules'}}}</h3>
    </header>
    <div class="pad-wrapper">
        <ol>
	    <li>{{{i18n '<b>ENGLISH</b> only in the chat.'}}}</li>
	    <li>{{{i18n 'No mentioning other streamers besides DyaRikku, unless they are directly related to her. This canvas is for her and her community only.'}}}</li>
            <li>{{{i18n 'Keep chat civil. No harassment or derogatory language.'}}}</li>
            <li>{{{i18n 'No hate speech. This includes emoji/symbols/ASCII art.'}}}
                <ul>
                    <li>{{{i18n 'This includes unnecessary swearing.'}}}</li>
                </ul>
            </li>
            <li>{{{i18n 'No spamming'}}}
                <ul>
                    <li>{{{i18n 'This includes excessive ASCII art/emojis/symbols/whitespace'}}}</li>
                </ul>
            </li>
            <li>{{{i18n "No copy pasta's"}}}</li>
            <li>{{{i18n 'No links to sites that actively break the canvas or chat rules (e.g. porn sites)'}}}</li>
            <li>{{{i18n 'No symbology which break the canvas or chat rules (e.g. NSFW ASCII art)'}}}</li>
            <li>{{{i18n 'No personal information'}}}</li>
	    <li>{{{i18n 'No doxxing of other participants'}}}</li>
            <li>{{{i18n 'Any sort of behavior that is considered unacceptable, disrespectful or uncomfortable by community members, DyaRikku or her mods will result in punishment, even if not explicitly stated in these rules, may result in a ban. Staff has the final say in any rule disputes.'}}}
                <ul>
                    <li>{{{i18n 'If you feel a moderator has acted inappropriately, please report it to an administrator.'}}}</li>
                </ul>
            </li>
        </ol>
    </div>
</article>
